 A web-based package manager interface for Cockpit that provides:
  - Browse packages by PackageKit group (cross-distribution compatible)
  - Search and filter packages by name or description
  - View detailed package information, dependencies, and file lists
  - Install and remove packages with progress tracking
  - Modern React-based UI with PatternFly components
